WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.210
Fear, excitement, and thrills-the triple package!

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.000
That's me, "Pandæmonium"!

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.630
"Pandemonium"? The same name as the prison of fog...

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:20.830
It was my name to begin with,
before they started calling the fog that.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:27.630
The Ivory one made the fog, not me.
So don't get that mixed up, okay?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:32.330
<i>I see, so you're simply the Pure Concept of Chaos, then.</i>

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.210
Yup, exactly!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.040
Then shall we get this movie started?

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.290
<b>Episode 11:</b>

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.290
<b>Pandæmonium</b>

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:19.170
I sense a bit of the Ivory one in you.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:20.250
That's odd.

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.540
First, that hole!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.170
I have to close that gate to the
dimension of original sin!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.330
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.330
<b><i>12:1-Invoke</i></b>

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.330
<b><i>[Hammer in, hammer in,</i></b>

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.330
<b><i>so as to fortify.]</i></b>

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.420
Maa! Amazing!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:40.580
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:40.880
<b><i>[Thread]</i></b>

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:51.500
M-maa, oh no! You've captured me so easily!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:56.170
After all, of the Four Major Human Errors I'm the weakest,

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.210
but I'm also known as the worst of the lot:

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.880
Pandæmonium!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:05.580
An illusion? No, I can sense they're both real!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:11.830
Jeez! I can't believe I'd get tripped up so easily.
I'm so useless!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.880
I'm sorry. I'm weak.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.000
I know that! I'm me too, after all!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.790
There!

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.830
Great work on the warm-up match, Miss!

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:43.290
We haven't met in this instance of Time yet,
but let me just say this...

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.880
I hate you, Momo.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.670
You always try to keep Menou for yourself.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.330
Still...

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.460
<b><i>Etheric Connect-ImPr•–?cHmnt,</i></b>

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.460
<b><i>Pure Concept [Time]-Invoke [Regression</i></b>

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.580
Hang in there. Don't die, okay?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:16.130
You live up to your name as the source of original sin.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:20.500
It makes sense that you used Manon Libelle
in an attempt to spread monstrine.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.290
Monstrine is made from your blood.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.040
By making people ingest a part of you,

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:30.540
you infested their bodies to use them
as sacrifices for your resurrection.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.290
Half of that isn't right, Miss.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:38.580
I didn't want to resurrect myself.
I just wanted to try doing a movie!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.540
"Doing... a movie"?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:45.670
Like I said, I love watching movies!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:49.540
But you know, there aren't any movies in this world.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.500
I couldn't ignore that, so I'm doing one!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.960
So yeah, I want you to be the heroine of this panic film!

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:00.960
All you need to do is desperately run
to-and-fro away from me, a.k.a. the monster!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.000
What could you possibly gain
from doing something like that?!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.880
No gain. That's not the point.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:14.630
See, humans are fun to watch when
they're trying their absolute best,

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.960
whether they live or die!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.630
What's important is the process.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.250
Watching people doing their best
and dying is so, sooooo...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.040
...much fun!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.380
Who do you think you are?!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:30.000
I mean, that's what B movies are all about.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.540
Some sudden calamity happens,
there are heaps of victims,

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.920
occasionally the main character dies,
humanity goes extinct,

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.380
and sometimes it even ends
with the monster winning!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.710
But I think that's the truth, in a way.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.790
After all, isn't reality...

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:48.290
beyond one's control, just like a monster?

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.540
<b><i>Ether: Living Sacrifice-Chaos Adhesion,</i></b>

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.540
<b><i>Pure Concept [Chaos]-</i></b>

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.540
<b><i>Summon [Squeak squeak, dig here!]</i></b>

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.830
Come now, Miss!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.290
I oversee the mass of monsters
infesting the eternal world!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:03.830
If you say you can stop a monster like me,
go ahead and try!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.040
What in the world happened to him?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.880
He was used as a sacrifice in sin magecraft.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:21.880
I sensed a large, twisted conjuring earlier.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.580
We've received word that there are people
who have melted all over the city!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.790
Those who had been taking monstrine, no doubt.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.750
Go quickly and get information on how many.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.710
Right!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.830
What's going on over there?

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.790
<b><i>[Thou shalt know that</i></b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.790
<b><i>walls surrounding pious</i></b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.790
<b><i>sheep shall never crumble.]</i></b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.790
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.790
<b><i>2:5-Invoke</i></b>

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.580
Maa, how aggravating!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.130
There, eat up!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.080
<b><i>[Kneel before the front gate,</i></b>

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.080
<b><i>for its path leads to the Lord.]</i></b>

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.080
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.080
<b><i>8:12-Invoke</i></b>

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.830
A triple invocation of scripture magecraft!

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:52.040
That's very skillful,
but you have pretty mediocre etheric capacity.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.330
You're already almost out.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.790
So that thing is what caused a
hundred people to melt away?

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.210
You...!

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:26.670
I'll act as if we're meeting for the first time, Miss Priestess.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.210
I'm Ashuna Grisarika.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:33.170
What are you fighting against?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.210
One of the Four Major Human Errors, Pandemonium.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.380
I see.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:40.790
Your Highness...

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:44.710
You just mentioned that a hundred
people melted away.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:45.880
Indeed.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.420
Though we may not have accounted for all of them.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:53.380
That number is probably...
the number of lives that thing has.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.670
So we must kill it a hundred times to defeat it?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.290
Nice and clear-cut.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:05.210
Or perhaps, we may be able to take it out in one blow...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.080
...with Your Highness's help.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.460
Oh?

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:17.170
Maa, maa! We have a new guest, I see!

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:21.500
But with my hands gone,
I can't welcome you with a handshake.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.040
That's her?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.460
I see, the worst possible encounter, indeed.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:30.380
So? Are you truly up to the task?

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.710
Yes, I can definitely do it!

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:33.960
Interesting!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.210
Then go ahead and prove it!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:36.750
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:37.420
<b><i>[Slash: Expansion]</i></b>

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:59.170
Ordinarily, humans cannot use power that
goes beyond their etheric capacity.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.580
However...

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.500
She connected the earthen and heavenly veins.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.540
What impressive etheric control!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:24.250
Maa! I really do think you're like the Ivory one,
just a tiny little bit.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.040
<b><i>Etheric Connect-1:2 Full Passage-Invoke</i></b>

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.000
<b><i>Beyond the mountains,</i></b>

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.000
<b><i>there was nothing to be found in the plains</i></b>

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.000
<b><i>below. Morning, afternoon, and night.</i></b>

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.000
<b><i>The exhausted people were at a loss.</i></b>

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.630
<b><i>Blam, blam.</i></b>

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.630
<b><i>A sound echoed,</i></b>

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.630
<b><i>and the people raised their heads.</i></b>

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.630
<b><i>The woman said nothing.</i></b>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.170
<b><i>Mouth closed,</i></b>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.170
<b><i>she raised her hand</i></b>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.170
<b><i>and struck with a hammer.</i></b>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.170
<b><i>All eyes were focused</i></b>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.170
<b><i>on the woman.</i></b>

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.710
<b><i>In order to do what must be done,</i></b>

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.710
<b><i>the woman raised her arm.</i></b>

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.710
<b><i>She simply hammered the stake,</i></b>

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.710
<b><i>to make known the land where all shall begin.</i></b>

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:35.170
A pseudo-church, huh? Wow, just wow!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.540
I think your efforts are victorious-!

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.170
Did that do it?

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.290
Yes...

00:10:56.290 --> 00:11:00.040
I connected the ether of the earthen vein
to the heavenly vein in an endless cycle,

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.960
so this binding force is practically permanent.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.790
In all honesty...

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.330
It helped that there weren't too many sacrifices.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.540
I wouldn't have managed without Your Highness's help.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.580
I truly appreciate it.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.880
Don't mention it. I'm glad I got to watch.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.170
That was some amazing magecraft.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.210
By the way, well...

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.330
Is Momo all right?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:32.540
We were actually supposed to meet last night,
to compare what we had accomplished.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.540
But she never came.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.460
Momo... was poisoned during an investigation.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:40.630
What?!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.920
And? How is she?!

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:46.750
I can't say she's doing well, but she should live.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.630
For now, she's at the church-

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.670
M-Menou!

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:10.830
No, no.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.330
Not you!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.040
It would be no fun if you went there.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.250
Stay here and play with me!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.750
You're...

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.830
Thank you, Your Highness Princess Ashuna.

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:48.960
No thanks necessary.
You should save your ether for later.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.040
In any case...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.500
The size of that thing is beyond ridiculous.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.460
Yoo-hoo!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.380
What do you think?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.130
She's one of my favorites!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.580
Isn't she cute?

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.330
She's definitely one of the Four Major Human Errors...

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:10.670
Indeed. A true monstrosity.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:13.290
Maa, that's awful! A monstrosity?!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.830
I'm a cute little monster!

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:21.880
What are you?

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.920
Maa! Should I introduce myself?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.170
She's stopped... isn't she?

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.290
Do you understand now?

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:54.130
I'm one of Four Major Human Errors,
<i>the Pure Concept of Chaos.</i><b></b>

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.830
Why are you getting in my way?!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:11.790
Because if you go there the movie
will become something different!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:15.290
After I went through the trouble of summoning that cutie.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:21.250
You know, this one's super duper strong!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:26.330
Because she fortified herself through
cannibalism for a looong time in the fog!

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:27.790
"Cannibalism"?

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.250
Yup!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.500
So this one's just a bit different
from the ones from before!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.380
So... are you two ready?

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:44.540
Then if I defeat you here,
will that monster disappear too?

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.960
Maa! Maa, maa!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.210
You, defeat me?!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:54.040
I may be weak, but you're even weaker.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.380
<i>You silly, overconfident user of Time.</i>

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.830
But if you still don't mind, let's get started!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:07.130
Boo!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:12.580
You see now, right? You're no match for me.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:17.170
That kind of fight scene is just boring in a movie,
don't you think?

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.170
Then what did you come here for?

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:20.880
Let's see...

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:24.830
What if I said I wanted to talk with
someone from my homeland?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.880
About something nostalgic from Japan!

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.960
No way!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:31.630
You're a Human Error, aren't you?

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:34.580
You must have used your
Pure Concept so many times

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.830
you can't possibly have any memories left!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.380
Maa! I'm impressed you know that!

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:43.790
Every time you use a Pure Concept,
it erodes your soul.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.710
I still want to hear about it, though!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:52.830
The things you remember,
and your precious memories from Japan-

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.250
I don't want them!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.380
I don't want my old world.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:15:59.670
I...

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.790
I've forgotten a lot already.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:06.750
But I remember the feeling that
the world was good for nothing.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.000
<b>Note: A vase of flowers on a desk is usually for a dead student</b>

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.000
<b>(i.e. Akari was being bullied)</b>

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:13.000
Is a world like that really worth anything?

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.500
Oh! But of course it is!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.460
The world doesn't exist for your sake, you know.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:23.790
We exist for the sake of the world!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:27.210
Anyway, none of that matters.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:32.630
To tell you the truth, I just came to thank you.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.830
Thank me?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:35.330
Yup!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:40.750
Because I was able to escape
that fog all thanks to you!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.710
Thanks... to me?

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.420
I suppose we should start by slicing up this tentacle!

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:58.170
No, Princess Ashuna. There's no need for that.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.250
What? Then what do we do?

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:04.670
There's no need to do anything. Look, there it is.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:09.790
This monster is still sealed within the prison of fog.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.460
I imagine it's only been summoned temporarily.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.880
Maa! I'm surprised you figured it out, Miss!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:19.710
I guess I can't bring her out completely just yet.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:22.630
And now the fog has found me, too!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:24.540
Pandemonium...

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:27.380
You're not the real one, are you?

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.790
Maa! What gave me away?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.210
Except for that massive one,

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:36.580
the monsters you've summoned
aren't particularly strong.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.540
And just look at the state of your
precious minion over there.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.920
If a monster that serves you is still trapped in the fog,

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.670
there's no way you could have escaped yourself.

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:50.330
The you here... is just a little portion, isn't it?

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:55.290
That's right, I'm just a finger puppet.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:58.670
I somehow managed to squeeze just a
pinky finger out through a gap in

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:01.960
the fog when it got warped,
and gave it human form.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:03.380
A "gap"?

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.460
Why would there be such a
thing in the prison of fog?!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.960
Hmm, I can't tell you that.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:13.920
But Miss Priestess, you alone might understand why!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:18.380
Could it be... it has to do with Akari?

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:21.040
You know how you turned back time?

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:25.330
On this world,
over and over and over and ooover?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.130
I heard it in the fog, you know.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:32.710
The sound of you regressing time and
making the world creak under the stress!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.880
That's what warped the fog too, and made a gap.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.170
And I was able to get a pinky out.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.130
You mean-

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:45.670
The stuff happening in this city are
totally aaaall because of you!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:53.960
I wish you could warp it even more
so that all of me can escape,

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.380
but I guess that isn't possible.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:19:00.040
You've lost too much of your memories, after all.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.210
If you want to stay intact,

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:07.130
you're at the point where you need to
refrain from using your Pure Concept at all.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.380
I mean, you've forgotten
so much that your personality

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:13.580
isn't what it was like in Japan anymore, right?

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.000
So what? I don't care about that.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:23.420
I have a best friend in this world
I'd be happy to risk my life for!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.420
A friend so precious,

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:29.630
I don't care if I lose all my memories
as long as I remember her!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:30.580
Maa?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.540
Get out of my way!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.250
All I care about is getting killed by Menou!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.170
I won't become like you...

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.630
I won't become a Human Error!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.040
You don't mind getting killed by her?
What a beautiful friendship!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:12.580
But I feel sorry for you.
You don't realize you're at a dead end.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.830
You really believe that there's a way out.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:20.790
But there is! Why wouldn't there be?!
That's what this power is for!

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:24.420
No. You'll never make it.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.130
Because to the people who can
connect to the Astral Archive,

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.290
<i>your Regression means nothing.</i>

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.750
"Astral... Archive"?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.460
Yup...

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:39.920
The memories of this planet and what powers ether.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:44.290
The origin of the Lord written about
in the priestesses' scriptures.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.170
There's no way to cheat it.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:52.460
Even up to this point,
it's no accident you kept failing, you know.

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:55.250
Someone used their power to make sure you failed.

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:58.000
"Someone"...?

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.000
You have an idea of who it might be?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:07.710
It's probably that person who
keeps getting in your way.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.250
So listen, here's something you'll want to know.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:14.920
It exists. A way back to Japan.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.750
This was all caused by Akari?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:26.670
So now there's yet another reason why
I have to kill her as soon as possible.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.540
<i>But for now, I have to defeat her!</i>

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:37.460
Maa! With the fog surrounding me,
I guess this body is done for.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.960
It lasted longer than expected, though.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.920
Anyway, that's fine.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.880
Let's move on to the next scene!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:47.960
The classic ending trope!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:51.290
The big bad uses all its energy to become enormous!

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:56.080
I'm going to put all of the sacrifices
I got in this city towards it!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:05.630
Come! It's time for the blood-stirring,
flesh-splattering climax!

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>The Duo's Journey</b>

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:40.040
Next episode: The Duo's Journey.
